    "title": "Hiring Medical Officer at Cipla Global Group",
    "description": "Cipla Global Group is actively seeking a talented and motivated Medical Officer to join our dynamic team in Vadodara. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Cipla Global Group:\nCipla Global Group is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Provide high-quality patient care and maintain patient records\n• Ensure patient privacy and maintain confidentiality\n• Respond to medical emergencies and provide immediate care\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n• Diagnose and treat medical conditions following established protocols\n• Collaborate with pharmaceutical representatives and medical suppliers\n• Attend continuing medical education programs and training\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• BPharm / MPharm / PharmD\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in NABH Standards\n• Proficiency in Wound Care\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in HIPAA Compliance\n• Proficiency in ICU Management\n• Proficiency in Infection Control\n• Proficiency in BLS/ACLS\n• Proficiency in Surgical Procedures\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Vadodara, Gujarat, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Cipla Global Group!",
